WEBVTT

00:16.880 --> 00:18.870
The seal has weakened, has it?

00:21.940 --> 00:24.880
It's still just one part of my body...

00:25.210 --> 00:27.360
But I suppose it'll have to do.

00:28.150 --> 00:29.090
Just watch,

00:29.900 --> 00:31.590
you old geezers!

00:36.310 --> 00:39.030
Today, we'll have a lesson 
on summoning magic.

00:39.030 --> 00:40.220
But first...

00:40.220 --> 00:42.180
Is Cain von Silford here?

00:42.180 --> 00:45.290
I know. I'm studying on my 
own again today, right?

00:45.290 --> 00:49.150
No, since we're not using attack 
magic today, you can participate.

00:49.150 --> 00:51.360
What?! Thank you!

00:51.360 --> 00:54.280
I've brought in a specialist to teach you.

00:54.670 --> 00:58.400
I normally work as a palace mage. 
My name is Gratt.

00:58.770 --> 01:01.040
There are two types of summon magic.

01:01.370 --> 01:05.370
One is to establish a bond with a 
monster and form a contract with it.

01:05.630 --> 01:09.290
The other is to summon one from a 
magic circle and form a contract with it.

01:09.290 --> 01:13.840
I get it! I formed a bond with Haku and Gin,
 and that's why we're contracted!

01:14.070 --> 01:16.830
We'll be testing your 
magic circle summoning today.

01:17.160 --> 01:18.570
Even if you manage to summon one,

01:18.570 --> 01:21.030
if you can't get along and 
fail to form a contract,

01:21.030 --> 01:22.430
it will quickly disappear.

01:22.840 --> 01:25.400
Use these to make your attempts.

01:25.740 --> 01:26.440
Begin!

01:31.040 --> 01:31.940
How cute!

01:31.940 --> 01:33.650
Will you form a contract with me?

01:34.010 --> 01:35.240
Okay, my turn!

01:38.660 --> 01:40.200
Contract with me!

01:43.120 --> 01:47.800
Unfortunately, you didn't have 
enough magic to make it submit.

01:48.140 --> 01:52.430
But just the fact that you summoned a 
fierce beast like that is impressive!

01:52.850 --> 01:56.800
Keep training hard to increase your 
magic until you can form a contract.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.580
Yes, sir!

01:57.580 --> 01:58.630
Okay, next...

01:58.630 --> 01:59.840
Is Cain here?

01:59.840 --> 02:00.730
Yes, sir.

02:00.730 --> 02:03.200
Everyone else is done, so you can try now.

02:03.200 --> 02:04.810
Okay. Then...

02:05.180 --> 02:09.560
I put as much of my magic as I can 
into this magic circle, right?

02:09.560 --> 02:12.690
But what if another crazy one shows up?!

02:12.690 --> 02:13.840
Don't worry.

02:13.840 --> 02:16.580
If you can't form a contract, 
it'll just leave,

02:16.580 --> 02:18.780
so you can put in all the magic you want.

02:18.780 --> 02:19.740
Okay, then...

02:19.980 --> 02:21.980
I'll put in all the magic I want!

02:23.950 --> 02:27.640
I hope I get one that 
Haku and Gin can play with.

02:27.640 --> 02:29.410
W-Wait a minute!

02:29.410 --> 02:31.380
This is...

02:34.000 --> 02:35.840
Wait! Any more than that and—

02:48.160 --> 02:52.270
Why has a human summoned me, 
the Prince of Darkness?

02:53.520 --> 02:54.980
Flash!

02:55.670 --> 02:56.980
My eyes!

02:57.680 --> 02:58.990
<i>Did he...</i>

02:58.990 --> 03:04.320
<i>just call himself the Prince of... Darkness?</i>

03:05.960 --> 03:07.770
<i>I'm a reincarnated noble</i>

03:07.770 --> 03:12.170
<i>whose magic increased too much, and now 
even my summoning is off the charts.</i>

03:13.250 --> 03:16.620
<i>It looks like I've summoned 
something pretty scary...</i>

03:16.620 --> 03:19.440
<i>Will I be able to keep this a secret?</i>

03:30.140 --> 03:33.020
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

04:50.530 --> 04:54.790
"Omen of an Onslaught"

04:53.430 --> 04:56.280
He called himself the Prince of Darkness.

04:56.280 --> 04:57.230
Is he...

04:58.110 --> 04:59.850
on Aaron's side?!

05:00.270 --> 05:02.350
So it was you who summoned me?

05:02.820 --> 05:04.530
Lowly human.

05:06.410 --> 05:08.070
<i>He saw my status!</i>

05:12.510 --> 05:13.290
He's coming for me...

05:14.250 --> 05:16.750
I-I'm so sorry I was rude!

05:16.750 --> 05:20.210
I'll serve as your underling! 
Please don't kill me, Chosen One!

05:20.210 --> 05:20.920
Huh?!

05:21.130 --> 05:24.680
I will gladly form a summoning 
contract with you, of course!

05:24.680 --> 05:28.420
If you were to give me an 
order to destroy a nation,

05:28.420 --> 05:31.420
I would deploy the full might of 
the demon clan to carry it out!

05:31.420 --> 05:33.530
Wait, why are you assuming I'd do that?!

05:33.530 --> 05:37.410
I won't destroy any nations, and I don't 
need the might of the demon clan!

05:37.410 --> 05:40.770
I see. If you were to change 
your mind, however...

05:40.770 --> 05:43.870
I am called by the name Seth.

05:43.870 --> 05:47.360
If you form a contract with me, 
you can summon me at any time.

05:47.360 --> 05:49.340
O-Okay...

05:49.340 --> 05:51.680
Also, please stop calling me "Chosen One."

05:51.680 --> 05:54.540
Could you just call me "Cain," Seth?

05:54.540 --> 05:57.400
Master Cain, you say? Very well.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.370
In that case...

05:58.750 --> 06:01.700
Please call me when you 
wish to destroy a nation.

06:03.550 --> 06:04.800
I just said...

06:04.800 --> 06:07.850
I won't destroy any nations, 
and I don't need the full might of—

06:07.850 --> 06:08.760
Cain!

06:09.970 --> 06:12.580
Was there just a guy calling 
himself the Prince of—

06:12.580 --> 06:15.420
Yes, but I couldn't form a contract,

06:15.420 --> 06:17.490
so he left right away!

06:17.490 --> 06:18.530
Really?

06:18.530 --> 06:19.980
Yes, really!

06:21.560 --> 06:22.910
Okay...

06:23.520 --> 06:26.250
We'll just... leave it at that.

06:26.610 --> 06:27.810
Yeah...

06:27.810 --> 06:30.570
<i>Thank goodness. I managed to cover it up.</i>

06:30.920 --> 06:33.030
<i>I didn't cover it up at all!</i>

06:33.030 --> 06:35.240
Tell me, Cain...

06:35.240 --> 06:37.750
What did you summon at school today?

06:38.360 --> 06:41.290
I'm sorry! My summoning 
magic called... a de...

06:41.290 --> 06:42.250
I can't hear you!

06:42.500 --> 06:44.680
I summoned a demon.

06:44.680 --> 06:46.960
Wrong! Tell me the truth, Cain!

06:47.290 --> 06:48.420
The Prince of Darkness.

06:49.920 --> 06:51.140
The Prince of Darkness?!

06:51.140 --> 06:54.650
And then what happened?! 
Surely you didn't send him straight back!

06:54.650 --> 06:56.050
I know you!

06:56.050 --> 06:59.520
You're right. I formed a contract 
with the Prince of Darkness.

07:00.840 --> 07:02.230
So it's true!

07:02.500 --> 07:05.780
Have you never heard of self-restraint?!

07:05.780 --> 07:09.930
Do you have any idea what would've 
happened if he'd gone on a rampage?!

07:09.930 --> 07:14.230
He could've destroyed the royal 
capital in the blink of an eye!

07:14.230 --> 07:18.710
I'm sorry! When I applied my magic, 
the circle just kept pulling it in!

07:18.710 --> 07:22.080
I never imagined something like 
that would come out of it!

07:22.080 --> 07:23.790
Hang on a minute!

07:23.790 --> 07:26.620
A demon would be one thing, 
but summoning the Prince of Darkness?

07:26.620 --> 07:27.920
Just how much magic do you have?

07:28.340 --> 07:32.820
Perhaps his training with the 
first king increased his magic.

07:32.820 --> 07:34.860
Th-The first king?!

07:34.860 --> 07:35.970
Cain.

07:36.350 --> 07:40.680
Show us what your insane 
status looks like now.

07:40.680 --> 07:41.640
Gratt...

07:41.640 --> 07:44.590
What you are about to see must 
never be spoken of outside this room.

07:44.590 --> 07:46.560
Consider it a state secret.

07:46.560 --> 07:49.440
You may assume that you will be 
executed if you tell anyone.

07:50.010 --> 07:52.680
Cain, let's see it.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.450
What do the numbers look like?

07:54.450 --> 07:57.390
All right. I'll open it now.

07:57.390 --> 07:59.120
Status Open!

07:59.200 --> 08:02.580
<b>Demigod</b>

08:00.640 --> 08:02.580
D-Demigod?!

08:02.580 --> 08:04.920
<b>Status Immeasurable</b>

08:02.580 --> 08:04.920
Status immeasurable?!

08:04.920 --> 08:07.400
Cain! What is this title?!

08:07.400 --> 08:08.590
Uh...

08:08.590 --> 08:10.490
Oh! You are a god!

08:10.490 --> 08:13.100
Wait, don't do that!

08:13.100 --> 08:16.080
But you're a demigod now.

08:16.080 --> 08:20.140
We'll have to start calling you 
Lord Cain... no, Master Cain.

08:20.140 --> 08:22.850
Come on! 
Not you, too, Prime Minister Magna!

08:22.850 --> 08:26.170
Cain, you won't actually 
destroy the kingdom, will you?

08:26.170 --> 08:29.700
Actually, forget the kingdom. 
You could destroy the entire world.

08:29.700 --> 08:31.780
I'm not going to do anything like that!

08:31.780 --> 08:33.820
Jeez, that's the same thing Seth said...

08:34.130 --> 08:35.280
The same thing?

08:35.280 --> 08:38.990
Please, could you all just 
treat me as you always have?

08:39.270 --> 08:40.650
I see...

08:40.650 --> 08:44.330
Very well. We'll treat 
you as we always have.

08:44.330 --> 08:46.110
But with this status,

08:46.110 --> 08:49.930
if you'd told me to hand over the 
kingdom to you, I might have!

08:49.930 --> 08:50.840
Your Majesty!

08:51.120 --> 08:52.050
Gratt.

08:53.220 --> 08:56.500
Do you now see why I told you 
this must not be spoken of?

08:57.070 --> 08:59.810
And, Cain, I will arrange an audience soon.

08:59.810 --> 09:02.980
Become a viscount. I will give you a town.

09:02.980 --> 09:05.100
You may do with it as you please.

09:05.100 --> 09:07.780
If you are successful, 
I will announce your engagement.

09:08.730 --> 09:11.750
I will not entertain any objections.

09:11.750 --> 09:14.570
It can be a town near the royal capital,

09:14.570 --> 09:17.860
and you can keep the local 
administration just as it is.

09:17.860 --> 09:21.790
A man who cannot protect a 
single house or a single town

09:21.790 --> 09:25.850
cannot hope to protect an entire nation.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.750
Congratulations!

09:31.750 --> 09:34.700
And what area will you have dominion over?

09:34.700 --> 09:37.930
Oh... I haven't been told yet.

09:37.930 --> 09:40.250
He said it'd be near the
 royal capital, but that's all.

09:40.250 --> 09:43.380
I'm certain you'll do just fine in any town!

09:43.380 --> 09:46.560
I know! Let's celebrate today, even if 
it's only the few of us closest to you!

09:46.560 --> 09:47.350
Master Cain!

09:48.150 --> 09:49.350
Terrible news!

09:49.350 --> 09:54.280
Lord Garm just received urgent 
word from Master Djinn in Gracia.

09:54.720 --> 09:57.990
It seems that signs of an onslaught have 
been observed in the Forest of Monsters!

09:57.990 --> 09:59.450
What?!

10:05.320 --> 10:06.260
I should hurry.

10:07.140 --> 10:09.880
Brother Djinn, I have arrived.

10:09.880 --> 10:12.010
Cain! Long time no see.

10:12.010 --> 10:15.590
Actually, I guess I should start 
calling you "Master Cain" now, huh?

10:15.800 --> 10:18.220
Please don't. More importantly...

10:18.220 --> 10:21.090
Yes. There has been a vast 
increase in adventurers

10:21.090 --> 10:24.970
being attacked by monsters in the 
forest for the past couple of months.

10:25.320 --> 10:28.890
I sent out some high-ranking 
adventurers to look into it.

10:29.190 --> 10:31.980
They said the number of monsters 
roaming the forest has grown,

10:31.980 --> 10:33.190
and they've turned savage.

10:34.150 --> 10:37.780
You know about the incident
 a few decades ago

10:37.780 --> 10:40.680
when monsters went savage and left 
the confines of the forest, right?

10:41.450 --> 10:43.410
An onslaught, was it?

10:43.410 --> 10:46.240
<b>Onslaughts</b>

10:43.410 --> 10:46.240
If you compare it to records 
of past onslaughts,

10:46.240 --> 10:49.450
the state of the forest now 
is the same as it was then.

10:49.770 --> 10:51.690
So I contacted Father and asked him

10:51.690 --> 10:56.700
to send out adventurers across the 
land via the adventurers' guild.

10:56.700 --> 10:59.470
But if all we have are signs, 
we can't do much more than that.

10:59.470 --> 11:02.680
You mean they can't say for 
certain that it's an onslaught?

11:02.680 --> 11:06.420
Exactly. We can't send out knights 
and soldiers on a massive scale

11:06.420 --> 11:09.020
and pretend nothing serious is going on.

11:09.020 --> 11:11.460
So we're handling it carefully.

11:11.460 --> 11:15.400
All right. I'll go take a 
look around the forest.

11:15.680 --> 11:19.350
Wait! I can't allow the head of a 
noble household to take such a risk!

11:19.350 --> 11:21.200
Besides, you're still—

11:21.200 --> 11:23.950
What? A-rank?! But how?!

11:23.950 --> 11:25.370
Some things happened.

11:25.370 --> 11:28.140
My abilities have earned 
their seal of approval, too.

11:28.140 --> 11:30.160
Remember? You already know about...

11:30.940 --> 11:32.370
The red dragon?

11:32.370 --> 11:33.320
Yes.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.580
Right...

11:34.580 --> 11:38.020
In that case, sorry to trouble you,
 but I'd like your help.

11:38.020 --> 11:40.300
I'll do everything I can, as well.

11:40.540 --> 11:43.770
I'll pay a visit to the 
adventurers' guild in town first.

11:44.110 --> 11:46.980
I should be able to gather information 
about the forest there.

11:46.980 --> 11:48.010
Please do.

11:48.300 --> 11:49.050
Thanks.

11:56.250 --> 11:59.470
Damn, sending out little kids now?

11:59.470 --> 12:03.170
The guild in the capital must 
really be short-handed.

12:03.170 --> 12:04.780
Let's see your adventurer's card.

12:05.740 --> 12:07.970
What?! A-rank?!

12:07.970 --> 12:08.660
Ow!

12:08.660 --> 12:12.290
Master Cain! I apologize for this 
rookie's lack of discipline.

12:12.710 --> 12:14.000
It's good to see you again.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.110
Rudy!

12:15.110 --> 12:18.930
I'm so glad you remembered me. 
What an honor.

12:18.930 --> 12:20.370
What brings you here today?

12:20.370 --> 12:25.220
This town's administrator, 
my brother Djinn, just told me

12:25.460 --> 12:27.680
that there's trouble in the forest.

12:28.810 --> 12:29.660
That's right.

12:29.970 --> 12:33.020
There are definitely increasing 
signs of an onslaught.

12:33.020 --> 12:37.110
It's difficult to even get near the forest
 because the monsters have become so savage.

12:37.110 --> 12:39.190
Many people have been injured.

12:39.190 --> 12:40.660
I see...

12:40.660 --> 12:42.050
Hey, Cain!

12:42.400 --> 12:44.130
Cain, it's you!

12:44.130 --> 12:47.070
Oh, Maestra Millie and Maestra Nina!

12:48.650 --> 12:50.490
What brings you two here?

12:50.490 --> 12:53.430
What about you, Cain? 
What are you doing here?

12:53.430 --> 12:55.900
This is my hometown.

12:55.900 --> 12:59.190
My brother is the administrator 
here, and he sent for me.

12:59.190 --> 13:00.630
Ah, I see.

13:00.630 --> 13:02.640
But why are you two here?

13:02.640 --> 13:03.380
Actually...

13:03.610 --> 13:05.300
The guild asked us to come.

13:05.620 --> 13:08.470
They've put out a call to 
all high-ranking adventurers.

13:08.470 --> 13:11.430
So you've already been to the forest?

13:12.370 --> 13:15.480
There are many monsters, 
and they're stronger.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.750
So it's true...

13:16.750 --> 13:19.050
And they move in groups,

13:19.050 --> 13:22.150
so the two of us can't go 
much deeper on our own.

13:22.410 --> 13:24.620
My brother and his wife 
are on their way here,

13:24.620 --> 13:26.110
so we're going to join up with them.

13:26.320 --> 13:28.690
Oh, Claude and Lina are coming?

13:28.690 --> 13:30.580
That's very reassuring!

13:30.790 --> 13:33.690
What are you going to do now, Master Cain?

13:33.690 --> 13:34.850
Rudy!

13:35.370 --> 13:37.960
I'm going to go check out the forest.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.320
You can't go alone.

13:39.320 --> 13:42.670
She's right. Why don't you 
wait for Claude with us?

13:42.950 --> 13:46.270
But I want to get an idea of what's 
going on as soon as possible.

13:46.270 --> 13:50.710
But if something were to happen to 
a noble and landowner like you,

13:50.710 --> 13:52.680
that would create its own problems.

13:52.680 --> 13:56.630
Plus, our guild would have to assume 
responsibility, and we really can't...

13:56.630 --> 13:58.860
I'm pretty strong, though.

13:58.860 --> 14:00.020
We know that.

14:00.020 --> 14:04.440
It'd be better if you had someone 
to go with you, at least...

14:04.440 --> 14:07.210
Well, I do! Not a person, but...

14:10.160 --> 14:11.200
Summon!

14:11.200 --> 14:12.550
Haku! Gin!

14:18.710 --> 14:20.420
It's really something, huh?

14:20.730 --> 14:22.650
We're going to investigate this forest.

14:22.650 --> 14:25.160
If you sense anything, can you let me know?

14:26.760 --> 14:27.720
Search!

14:29.770 --> 14:33.600
<i>What is this? I feel like I'm being watched.</i>

14:35.850 --> 14:36.770
<i>It's not this thing.</i>

14:37.110 --> 14:37.850
<i>Or this one...</i>

14:38.070 --> 14:38.940
<i>Or this one...</i>

14:39.510 --> 14:40.910
<i>Or this one.</i>

14:42.720 --> 14:44.340
Something's definitely strange.

14:44.650 --> 14:46.750
Maybe I'll have him check it out for me.

14:47.070 --> 14:48.190
Summon Seth!

14:52.320 --> 14:55.540
Who has summoned me, the Prince of Darkness—

14:55.540 --> 14:56.620
Hi.

14:56.620 --> 14:59.210
Master Cain! Seth is at your service!

14:59.210 --> 15:02.440
Sorry to ask, but I'd like you 
to investigate this forest.

15:02.440 --> 15:06.210
My Search isn't working, and something 
feels weird, don't you think?

15:06.210 --> 15:08.960
I thought maybe you could 
figure something out.

15:10.030 --> 15:10.680
True...

15:11.370 --> 15:14.620
There is a being beyond here 
with an overwhelming presence.

15:14.620 --> 15:15.890
I believe that is the cause.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.850
An overwhelming presence?

15:17.850 --> 15:23.060
Yes, and it appears a massive number 
of monsters are trying to reach it.

15:23.430 --> 15:26.180
There are many monsters 
in my homeland, as well,

15:26.180 --> 15:27.720
but this is not normal.

15:28.230 --> 15:30.740
And they are all quite high-level creatures.

15:30.740 --> 15:34.950
If monsters that strong get into 
Gracia, there'll be big trouble!

15:34.950 --> 15:37.910
Seth, can you figure out any more details?

15:38.240 --> 15:42.060
If that's what you need, I have a 
subordinate who specializes in investigation.

15:42.060 --> 15:43.760
May I call him?

15:43.760 --> 15:45.290
Yes, please.

15:45.290 --> 15:45.750
Then...

15:46.120 --> 15:47.590
Summon Dalmatia!

15:51.610 --> 15:54.890
My, Lord Seth. How may I be of service?

15:54.890 --> 15:56.180
Well...

15:57.780 --> 15:58.930
L-Lord Seth!

15:59.270 --> 16:00.930
Who is this?

16:00.930 --> 16:04.410
He is called Cain, and he is 
the one I am contracted to.

16:04.410 --> 16:06.130
To God's Chosen?!

16:06.130 --> 16:08.160
He is the god who will conquer this world!

16:09.610 --> 16:13.550
Seth, you dork! I'm not gonna conquer 
anything, and I'm no god at all!

16:13.550 --> 16:16.410
Just hurry up and investigate 
the forest already!

16:16.410 --> 16:18.030
Oh, right.

16:18.030 --> 16:21.270
Dalmatia here was once one 
of the Four Heavenly Kings,

16:21.270 --> 16:23.250
and he specializes in investigation.

16:23.570 --> 16:27.970
I am now retired, 
but my skills have not waned.

16:27.970 --> 16:31.010
Okay, good. 
Dalmatia, investigate this forest.

16:31.010 --> 16:33.470
As you wish, Chosen One.

16:33.470 --> 16:34.680
I'm Cain!

16:35.930 --> 16:37.530
Wh-What's that?

16:37.530 --> 16:40.220
This is my special ability.

16:40.530 --> 16:41.770
Wait, this is...

16:41.770 --> 16:43.600
Don't tell me!

16:43.600 --> 16:45.680
Shall I show you?

16:45.680 --> 16:48.290
No! Please don't let those out!

16:48.290 --> 16:51.150
I will ensure you do not see them, then.

16:57.000 --> 16:58.700
There are monsters like that, too?

17:00.370 --> 17:02.580
Oh, my! Just look at that!

17:06.990 --> 17:10.880
Lord Seth, is that the 
power of God's Chosen?

17:12.660 --> 17:13.930
Seth!

17:14.920 --> 17:16.530
I'll let you handle things here.

17:16.530 --> 17:19.840
We're going back to town for a bit 
to let them know what's going on.

17:19.840 --> 17:20.880
Bye!

17:21.240 --> 17:23.730
We didn't even need to lift our swords...

17:23.730 --> 17:28.770
And if we had, we would have 
been killed in an instant.

17:29.990 --> 17:31.470
What the heck is all this?

17:31.470 --> 17:33.670
They're all monsters I've never seen before.

17:33.670 --> 17:34.980
I can't believe it...

17:34.980 --> 17:37.820
These are all A-rank and S-rank, right?

17:37.820 --> 17:40.160
What the heck is this?!

17:40.710 --> 17:42.490
Claude! Lina!

17:42.490 --> 17:44.310
Where did all these come from?

17:44.310 --> 17:46.460
They were in the Forest of Monsters.

17:46.460 --> 17:47.520
These things?!

17:47.520 --> 17:49.040
Yes, it seems they were.

17:49.270 --> 17:52.250
If these things came into 
the town, it would be...

17:52.250 --> 17:56.390
It sounds like there are even stronger 
monsters deep in the forest.

17:56.390 --> 17:58.180
You need to strengthen the watch.

17:59.750 --> 18:01.100
I see.

18:01.100 --> 18:05.580
It appears something beyond here 
is trying to intimidate us.

18:05.580 --> 18:08.120
It says, "Don't you dare come any closer!"

18:08.120 --> 18:11.680
Oh? It wants to intimidate me, does it?

18:11.680 --> 18:12.570
Amusing.

18:12.980 --> 18:16.030
Dalmatia, you haven't 
gotten rusty, have you?

18:16.030 --> 18:19.410
Well, I have not fought in a very long time,

18:19.410 --> 18:21.800
so I fear I may have.

18:21.800 --> 18:23.220
You jest.

18:23.220 --> 18:26.270
Think of this as physical therapy to 
quickly bring your condition back up.

18:26.270 --> 18:27.500
We're going in.

18:27.500 --> 18:29.440
Understood.

18:29.440 --> 18:32.960
This promises to be some 
strenuous physical therapy.

18:34.970 --> 18:37.660
What's that coming closer to me?

18:38.160 --> 18:42.430
They don't seem to be followers 
of the old geezers.

18:42.430 --> 18:43.600
This is...

18:50.150 --> 18:53.740
Go, all of you! 
It's time to start the game!

18:53.740 --> 18:57.630
Rampage! Devour the humans!

19:00.910 --> 19:02.950
We must warn Master Cain at once!

19:02.950 --> 19:03.490
Move!

19:04.540 --> 19:05.330
What is it?

19:10.090 --> 19:10.890
Master Cain!

19:10.890 --> 19:11.600
Who are—

19:11.600 --> 19:13.660
It's okay! I know him!

19:13.660 --> 19:15.380
Master Cain, this is an emergency!

19:15.680 --> 19:18.990
It's an onslaught! 
The monsters have begun to move in concert!

19:18.990 --> 19:19.740
Huh?!

19:19.740 --> 19:20.710
What?

19:20.710 --> 19:24.760
Rudy, please inform my brother 
Djinn in his mansion.

19:24.760 --> 19:28.060
Claude and Lina, 
please assemble the adventurers.

19:28.060 --> 19:31.240
I need you to keep the monsters 
from getting into town.

19:31.240 --> 19:32.510
What about you?

19:32.510 --> 19:35.270
I'm heading to the Forest of Monsters.

19:35.270 --> 19:37.390
It's too dangerous, Master Cain!

19:37.390 --> 19:39.570
Don't worry. I've got...

19:40.500 --> 19:42.770
some friends who aren't 
registered as adventurers,

19:42.770 --> 19:46.280
but who are still stronger than A-rank.

19:46.280 --> 19:50.290
Master Cain... Did you just 
refer to me as a friend?

19:50.950 --> 19:53.070
If you say that to me,

19:53.070 --> 19:56.630
I have no choice but to lay 
down my life to assist you!

19:56.630 --> 19:57.840
Let's go, Seth!

19:57.840 --> 19:58.920
At once!

19:58.920 --> 20:01.170
Dear husband!

20:01.170 --> 20:02.880
Tijuana?!

20:04.820 --> 20:07.020
Dear husband!

20:07.020 --> 20:08.100
Why are you...

20:08.100 --> 20:12.410
Margrave Garm requested emergency 
backup from the Chivalric Order.

20:12.410 --> 20:13.820
Did you come alone?

20:13.820 --> 20:16.650
I left in such a hurry that I got here first.

20:16.650 --> 20:18.640
Daim and the others are behind me.

20:18.640 --> 20:21.090
More importantly, 
an onslaught has begun, has it?

20:21.090 --> 20:23.630
Yeah. I'm on my way to the forest now.

20:23.630 --> 20:24.750
Then I will also—

20:24.750 --> 20:27.940
No, I need you to lead this town's knights

20:27.940 --> 20:29.870
and protect the town and the adventurers...

20:30.410 --> 20:33.210
To protect my home.

20:34.420 --> 20:36.690
Protect my dear husband's home?!

20:36.690 --> 20:39.170
My dear husband's home?!

20:39.380 --> 20:43.090
Understood! I will keep 
it safe in your absence!

20:43.090 --> 20:44.420
I'm counting on you!

20:44.420 --> 20:46.050
Yes, dear husband!

20:46.050 --> 20:47.230
Be safe!

20:48.150 --> 20:51.130
Master Cain, why go to 
the trouble of running?

20:51.130 --> 20:53.480
Can you not use Move magic?

20:53.480 --> 20:57.000
There aren't many humans who can use that!

20:57.000 --> 21:00.400
I actually freaked out a little 
when you used it before!

21:00.400 --> 21:02.760
Try to show a little self-restraint!

21:03.350 --> 21:04.320
<i>Is that so?</i>

21:04.980 --> 21:07.410
<i>It must be difficult to be a human.</i>

21:13.160 --> 21:18.630
Ah, how nostalgic! 
There's nothing like the air of a battlefield!

21:20.270 --> 21:21.210
Dalmatia!

21:21.210 --> 21:22.860
Inferno!

21:22.860 --> 21:24.130
Inferno!

21:24.130 --> 21:26.240
Inferno!

21:26.480 --> 21:27.920
Oh, my.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.490
Master Cain!

21:28.490 --> 21:29.300
I know.

21:29.890 --> 21:31.220
It's past here, isn't it?

21:31.820 --> 21:34.680
That's where he is.

21:39.180 --> 21:42.650
I'm waiting for you, 
follower of the old geezers.

21:43.220 --> 21:47.000
The game has already begun.

21:49.810 --> 21:51.030
Aaron...

23:21.830 --> 23:24.920
Dear husband! Dear husband! 
Who are these people?!

23:25.260 --> 23:26.260
His friend.

23:26.260 --> 23:27.400
His friend's wife.

23:27.400 --> 23:29.200
His former tutor.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.130
His lover.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.510
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.540 --> 23:36.320
Lefahne?!

23:36.320 --> 23:37.290
Darling?!

23:36.950 --> 23:40.250
<b>"Then I Became Lord of a Domain"</b>

23:38.160 --> 23:39.980
Save that for when you're back home.
